{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d2d314281e057f489612466ce7c79964ff71bfe7139573590e1801fb11bc4b3", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n始まるまでは、まだ時間がかかるみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。看来要等一会儿才会开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "fc3ed160ff47952776c862a0ee84a0314b7217d8a27a5bf75c0578548b44080b", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nあの、撮影の準備はいかがでしょうか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n那个，拍摄准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8daec458f87229efb2bb68c794b00fc00cbf70b1a9be5a1d64d1ab542a92af9c", "ja": "ああ、貴音。それが、準備に手間取ってるみたいでね。\n悪いけど、しばらく待機しててくれるか？", "zh": "啊，贵音。那个，准备工作好像有点耽搁了。\n不好意思，能请你先等一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "ca3a888807abdf9e67fa4c1c77d2f921b1bc0f86bd9b21c4e3274e9700c2f682", "ja": "わかりました。そういうことなら仕方ありません。\n楽屋におりますので、何かあればお呼びください。", "zh": "明白了。既然是这样，那也没办法。\n我会待在休息室，有什么事请叫我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1004_null", "source_sha256": "77f682c7e947dc9078fa4b8ba512fe92d2c5fba430f3fe2adc68ca93a9c144fd", "ja": "20分後……", "zh": "20分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d754699616c55668b0083a4801a455678f0b27065220da5004285aaa28abbce3", "ja": "（状況を聞いてみたが、まだ時間がかかるようだ。\n貴音も気になるのか、いつになくソワソワしている）", "zh": "（我打听了一下情况，看来还要花些时间。贵音似乎也很在意，显得比平时更加坐立不安。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "20ba60b017047a436d1a098d469021981bf7ade61897a5a95aca90cd6b5a009e", "ja": "あの、{$P$}……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de9eb6be3a43eff6d4706d3b353deaa69f302adae58d053107e759c925bf2bb2", "ja": "待たせてすまない、貴音。様子が気になるよな。\nさっきから落ち着かないみたいだし……。", "zh": "抱歉让你久等了，贵音。很在意情况吧。\n看你刚才起就好像静不下心来的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "f865654026dc2bd2dde2d3d7fea7ae790bce0d59a0724ffa86fac14007771569", "ja": "私が、落ち着いてない……はて、そうなのですか？\nいつも通りに過ごしておりますが……。", "zh": "我，不安分……咦，是这样吗？\n我觉得自己一直都是平常的状态……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2c756b5f0c3f9293a4d0060beaa8e1bd525c5af4709382dce734b906669318c", "ja": "そうか……。なんだかソワソワしてると思ったけど、\n気のせいだったか。", "zh": "这样啊……我还以为你有点坐立不安，看来是我多心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "46614c21515f26ae5f819896e0c701b34d67f697f1e713c543f2b9752a6084a7", "ja": "そわそわ……？　ふむ、なるほど……。\nそれは気のせいなどではなく事実かと。", "zh": "坐立不安……？嗯，原来如此……\n那并不是错觉，而是事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf8757c26ba5d64aeb616be6383d4d7895e7ddc6bda010defe4c35f29712b7d4", "ja": "以前より、本日の撮影を待ちわびておりましたので。\nその、はやる気持ちが無意識に出ていたのかと……。", "zh": "因为我从很久以前就一直盼望着今天的拍摄。\n所以，那份迫切的心情不知不觉间表现出来了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ec683e3ee58255e56cac260b72e36e21548c3142896db846f7a2be87f662abc1", "ja": "ははっ、そういう事だったのか。ソワソワするくらい\nこのパジャマを気に入ったって事かな？", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这么回事啊。喜欢这件睡衣，喜欢到都坐立不安了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "515b3bf32e658f78a5b624186f3fcca4bf93b7907a8d68c4b0b3c40243cc03a1", "ja": "ええ。ぱじゃまのお仕事だと聞いた時は、\nもっとせくしーなものを思い浮かべておりました。", "zh": "是的。听说是睡衣相关的工作时，\n我还以为会是更加性感的睡衣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "345c328219cd1e2ae8960c94a3c45485175cc993aa7847d2c9eaf032cd1a25e0", "ja": "それがまさか……このように愛らしいぱじゃまとは。\nふふっ。真、嬉しいさぷらいずです。", "zh": "没想到竟然是……这么可爱的睡衣。\n呵呵，真是令人开心的惊喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eba9616bc9b23ad0cdf5665d3261b207461b6d401648d4ba8b8a1dd7ef90dae7", "ja": "セクシーは時と場合による……コホン！　この特集は、\nアイドルの自然な姿を見せる目的があるんだ。", "zh": "性感要视时间和场合而定……咳咳！这次特辑的目的，是展现偶像们自然的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d4bae115f5dbc9dcb04767d04bb81c31e26ab6e3a147e71476ac5823335c745c", "ja": "だから、貴音がリラックスできるようなパジャマを\n選んだつもりだけど……。", "zh": "所以，我本来是想选一套能让贵音放松的睡衣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0263_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "87b89304be06d381f395554eed34310c76f7a2d75bc09d17a978dc34144fbf3a", "ja": "そういうことでしたか。それなら本日の撮影は\n気合いをいれて、りらっくすしなければなりませんね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。既然如此，今天的拍摄就必须打起精神，好好放松才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
